From 85b3b7d9b9501de70eb8f47cf5518cb36621ef98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:30:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 36/37] bitproxy: in-app updater uses BitProxy releases

GitHubUpdateChecker reads github.com/zonicisalive/BitProxy releases
instead of SagerNet/sing-box, picks the APK for this phone's ABI (the
releases have one per ABI) and also offers releases with the same
sing-box version but a higher version code (BitProxy builds use
upstream code * 1000 + build number). Update checks, forced off while
the updater pointed upstream, are switched on once.
---
 .../sfa/vendor/GitHubUpdateChecker.kt         | 16 ++++++------
 .../nekohasekai/sfa/bitproxy/BitProxyInfo.kt  | 25 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../nekohasekai/sfa/bitproxy/BitProxyPrefs.kt |  4 +++
 .../sfa/bitproxy/BitProxyServiceHooks.kt      | 11 +++++---
 4 files changed, 45 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

